356	     is undefined.
357	     @see <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-syntax-3/#consume-name">CSS Syntax Module Level 3, Consume an ident sequence</a>
358	     @see <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-syntax-3/#typedef-ident-token">CSS Syntax Module Level 3, ident-token</a>
359	     */
